            "action_name": {
              "value": "Cunning Discernment"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Skartitch attempts a Recall Knowledge check against an opponent using the standard DC for a creature of that level. On a success, that opponent is flat-footed against Skartitch's attacks until the start of her next turn; on a critical success, the opponent is flat-footed against Skartitch's attacks for 1 minute."
